# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PATIENT DATA — NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data_raw/ holds the cached line list: one row per confirmed dengue patient,
# with the exact GPS coordinate of their home, plus age and sex. Publishing it
# would expose identifiable households. Everything the live forecast needs is
# in data_processed/, which is aggregated to Union Council x week counts.
data_raw/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet

# Any file that could carry a patient identifier
**/line_list*
**/patients*

